1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:01,800
[BOTTLE SHATTERS]

2
00:00:04,014 --> 00:00:05,054
(Leonard:)Thirty feet.

3
00:00:13,148 --> 00:00:14,528
(Penny:)Oh. Hey, Leonard.

4
00:00:14,691 --> 00:00:18,941
(Leonard:)I was a perfectly happy,
geeky, little lonely guy...

5
00:00:19,112 --> 00:00:21,032
...and then you ruined me.

6
00:00:21,865 --> 00:00:22,865
(Leonard:)Are you drunk?

7
00:00:23,033 --> 00:00:26,033
(Leonard:)Come on. We're gonna have sex
and it's not gonna mean a thing.

8
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,410
PENNY:
Are you out of your mind?

9
00:00:31,917 --> 00:00:35,207
(Leonard:)I'm really starting to think
there's a double standard here.

10
00:00:40,383 --> 00:00:44,303
(Sheldon:)In a few minutes, when I gloat
over the failure of this enterprise...

11
00:00:44,471 --> 00:00:47,561
(Sheldon:)...how would you prefer I do it?
The standard "I told you so"?

12
00:00:47,724 --> 00:00:49,054
With a classic "neener-neener"?

